      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orchard%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1915 Lithograph City had 15 houses, a hotel, a dance hall and a museum, reflecting its brief boom.",
